  "final_answer": "I have all the information I need. Let me provide my final answer with the verified product details.\n\nBased on my thorough browsing of Amazon.com, I have found several air fryers that meet all your criteria. Here are my top recommendations:\n\n## 🏆 Best Match: **KMFurnila Compact Digital Air Fryer 3 Qt**\n\n**Price: $28.91** (under $100 ✓)\n\n**All criteria verified:**\n- ✅ **Compact** - \"Slim streamlined body... Weighs only 5 lbs, ultra-light weight\"\n- ✅ **Capacity: 3 Qt** (within 2-3 qt range, marketed as 3QT with 3.17-quart square cooking basket)\n- ✅ **Digital Display** - \"sensitive touch control panel\" with \"Simple Touchscreen\"\n- ✅ **Auto Shutoff** - explicitly mentioned in product title (\"Auto Shutoff, Simple Touchscreen\")\n- ✅ **Under $100** - $28.91\n- ⭐ **4.3 out of 5 stars** (47 reviews) | **Overall Pick** | **200+ bought in past month**\n\n**About this item highlights:**\n- Adjustable temperature up to 400°F for diverse cooking\n- Works 4x quicker than traditional ovens\n- Nonstick plate with dishwasher-safe basket\n- Programmable with Temperature Control\n- Ideal for small families and limited kitchen space\n\n---\n\n### 🥈 Alternative Option: **Dash Tasti-Crisp Digital Air Fryer, 2.6 Quart**\n- **Price: $45.70** (Limited time deal, List: $59.99)\n- ✅ 2.6 Qt capacity | ✅ Digital | ✅ Explicit Auto Shut Off | ✅ Compact\n- ⭐ 4.5 out of 5 stars (8,028 ratings) | 200+ bought in past month\n\n---\n\n### 🥉 Another Option: **CHEFMAN 2 Qt Mini Air Fryer** (Overall Pick for this filter)\n- **Price: $42.44** (Limited time deal, List: $59.99)\n- ✅ 2 Qt capacity | ✅ Digital Timer + Shake Reminder | ✅ Compact | ✅ Space-Saving\n- ⭐ 4.5 out of 5 stars (29,903 ratings) | 9K+ bought in past month\n\n**My recommendation:** The **KMFurnila Compact Digital Air Fryer 3 Qt** is the best value match — it satisfies every one of your criteria (compact, 3 qt capacity, digital touchscreen display, auto shutoff, under $100) at the lowest price among the verified matches, and Amazon designated it as the \"Overall Pick\" for this search.",
